// Mahoning County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search and Direction Home of Eastern Ohio) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search is Pivot Point (auditor.mahoningcountyoh.gov);
//     July's "DDTI" label was wrong.
//   * The Mahoning County ESC is now the ESC of Eastern Ohio.
//   * Eastern Gateway Community College closed in 2025.
//   * The July YSU link was the Maag Library; YSU itself is now listed separately.
//   * The City of Canfield is at canfield.gov; Poland Township at polandtownship.gov;
//     Springfield and Canfield townships on their current domains.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Youngstown NY/FL; Boardman OR; Poland ME/NY; Campbell CA; Sebring FL;
//   craigbeachvillage.com now redirects to an unrelated site; mahoningmhrb.org is not
//   the Mental Health & Recovery Board (its site says so); Trumbull and Columbiana
//   bodies are left out; Washingtonville is filed under Columbiana County.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities: Youngstown (the seat), Campbell, Canfield and Struthers. Villages with
//     sites: Lowellville, New Middletown, Poland and Sebring; Beloit, Craig Beach and
//     Washingtonville have none. Large townships include Austintown and Boardman.
//   * Fourteen school districts, the ESC of Eastern Ohio, MCCTC, Valley STEM and
//     Youngstown State University.
//   * Mercy Health St. Elizabeth Youngstown and Boardman; Akron Children's Beeghly
//     campus; ONE Health Ohio (FQHC); Mill Creek MetroParks.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Beloit, Craig Beach and Washingtonville villages and Berlin, Coitsville and
//     Smith townships: no official site.
//   * The YMCA, Oakland Center for the Arts, Western Reserve Port Authority,
//     downtown groups, service clubs and some festivals were not reached.

